WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.991
Fluent readers use accurate words, a suitable pace and natural expression while

00:00:04.991 --> 00:00:05.789
checking understanding.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:11.594
What should a reader do after an unfamiliar word? Answer: Blend or decode it, then

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:12.590
reread the sentence.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:17.994
Read one paragraph aloud; repeat more smoothly, then explain its message.

00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:21.875
Discuss why: Decoding and rereading restore meaning.
